      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "EAC in-kernel driver is not enable \"CET Shadow Stack Compatible\" now(2023-05-10).\n\nhttps://techcommunity.microsoft.com/t5/windows-os-platform-blog/developer-guidance-for-hardware-enforced-stack-protection/ba-p/2163340\n\nI want a new EAC driver support Intel CET/AMD Shadow Stack.\n\nMy Workaround\n\nThis procedure disable Kernel-mode Hardware-enforced Stack Protection\n\n1. Open Configuration in Windows\n\n2. Open privacy and security settings\n\n3. Open Windows security\n\n4. Open Device Security\n\n5. Disable Kernel-mode Hardware-enforced Stack Protection\n\n6. Reboot Windows",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
